  "description": "City Walk is a design-inspired open-air lifestyle destination in Dubai, spanning over 10 million square feet of vibrant experiences. Situated on Al Safa Street, close to Sheikh Zayed Road and Jumeirah Street, this family-friendly hub integrates living, retail, F&B, entertainment, hospitality, and wellness options, creating a harmonious blend of comfort and community within one iconic location. Envisioned as a city within a city, City Walk has become the ultimate choice for residents and tourists seeking a sophisticated space to shop, dine, socialize, and spend quality time in a serene ambience. It also houses Canadian University Dubai and Talabat’s impressive 150,000 sq ft headquarters across two modern buildings. In 2023, the destination unveiled C2 at City Walk, a licensed district featuring some of Dubai’s most beloved dining and entertainment venues, including Brass Monkey, Nola, Mythos, Daikan, and La Serre, further enhancing its dynamic appeal.",
